OL,3,GNEWSAI won't let my daughter's killer
OL,4,Alive in my head, says Sarah Payne's
OL,5,Amother
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe mother of murdered schoolgirl Sarah
OL,8,FPayne says she wants to change how
OL,9,Fpeople see victims of crime.
OL,11,FSara Payne's daughter was abducted
OL,12,Fwhile playing with her siblings and
OL,13,Fmurdered in July 2000, aged just eight.
OL,15,FRoy Whiting - a convicted sex offender
OL,16,F- was jailed for life in December 2001
OL,17,Ffor her killing.
OL,19,FSara told BBC South East there were
OL,20,Fmany reasons behind how people behaved,
OL,21,Fbut they "still have choices".
